### IntelliJ HTTP Client
### Configure MySQL and start the application, then register/sign in using auth-api.http. Set photoPath to your image path.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
### Successful login in auth-api.http saves accessToken as a global variable.
@recordId = 3ec3b7e4-bba6-481e-8f21-e6c6dfeb1001
@photoPath = /absolute/path/to/meal.jpg

### 1. Upload and analyse (use a new recordId and actual mealTime for each new meal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dietary-records
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MealBoundary

--MealBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="recordId"

{{recordId}}
--MealBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profileVersion"

1
--MealBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mealTime"

2026-10-10T08:00:00Z
--MealBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photoProcessingConsent"

true
--MealBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="meal.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< {{photoPath}}
--MealBoundary--

### 2. Current member records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dietary-records?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dietary-records?page=1&size=20&status=PENDING_MEMBER_CONFIRMATION
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Record details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dietary-records/{{recordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Replace the complete food list (pending confirmation or DEFERRED with recognition only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dietary-records/{{recordId}}/foods
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foods": [
    {
      "name": "Cooked rice",
      "searchTerm": "Rice, white, long-grain, regular, enriched, cooked",
      "portionGrams": 180,
      "confidence": 0.7,
      "fdcId": null
    }
  ]
}

### 6. Confirm (validated records cannot be edited or abandoned)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dietary-records/{{recordId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Abandon (alternative to confirmation, subject to current state)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dietary-records/{{recordId}}/abandon
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Retry after a service failure (DEFERRED only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dietary-records/{{recordId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Validated record for Agent 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dietary-records/{{recordId}}/validated
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Downstream delivery status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dietary-records/{{recordId}}/delivery
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
